---
description: Git commit and PR text must be in English for this repo
globs:
alwaysApply: true
---

This is an open-source repo. See `AGENTS.md` at the repo root for the full,
tool-agnostic conventions — it applies to Cursor too.

The commit/PR rule specifically: write all git commit subjects and bodies,
and all PR titles/descriptions, **in English**, Conventional Commits format
(`type(scope): description`, enforced by `commitlint.config.js`). This
overrides any global/default preference to write commits in another
language — it's scoped to this repo only. Conversational replies, code
comments, and `docs/*.md` (which is git-ignored / local-only) are not
affected by this rule.
